    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποψηνίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prick from below,</i>
			like the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήν</span> (q.v.):
			metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεψηνισμένη,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκμαία πρὸς τόκον</span>
			 (prob. from a Comic poet), <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μένοι</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκμαῖοι</span>
			<u>Et.Gen.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>).</div>
